For streaming to work, your workflow must use a trigger that supports streaming responses, such as the [Chat Trigger](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n-docs/blob/main/docs/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.compression/n8n-nodes-base.compression.md) or [Webhook](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n-docs/blob/main/docs/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.webhook) node with **Response Mode** set to **Streaming**.
